        <activityName xml:lang="en">Printed wiring board, mounted, Laptop PC mainboard, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Printed wiring board, mounted, Laptop PC mainboard, at plant
Data are based on own assumption - assuming that after 2023 updates, 100% of all laptop PC mainboards are produced, using Pb-free solder materials.; UUID: 9ec400fd-2e9e-3dec-bfdf-3c4e1511fd5d
This dataset represents a mix of Pb-containing and Pb-free soldered laptop PC mainboards. It includes processes of components mounting using lead and lead free solder technology.
Location: Own estimation - used for the global average
Technology: Dataset represents the mix of lead and lead-free mounting of motherboards.
Time period: Unspecified
Production volume: 
Sampling: own estimation
Extrapolations: see Geography &amp; Technology
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_9ec400fd-2e9e-3dec-bfdf-3c4e1511fd5d.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
